SUMMARY:Figure Drawing Workshop [29]
LOCATION:VMFA Studio School\, 200 N Arthur Ashe Boulevard\, Richmond\, VA 23220
DESCRIPTION:One-session workshop. Explore drawings of the human form by other artists\, then work from a live model to create expressive portraits in charcoal and pencil. Instructor: Amy Smith. Prerequisite: basic drawing skills.\\n\\nCost: $95 (Member $80)\\n\\nRegister: https://www.vmfa.museum/classes/figure-drawing-workshop-29
URL:https://www.vmfa.museum/classes/figure-drawing-workshop-29
END:VEVENT
