DESCRIPTION:Queer Life Drawing at Gold Lion Community Cafe\, hosted by RVA Thriving Artists. Figure drawing with live queer-identified models.\\n\\nCost: $10 suggested donation\\n\\nRegister: https://www.goldlionrva.com/events
