SUMMARY:Nude Figure Drawing: Halloween Edition!
LOCATION:Unkindness Art\, 2923 North Avenue\, Richmond\, VA 23222
DESCRIPTION:Long-pose nude figure drawing session with a single partially costumed model\, Halloween themed. 18+ only\, valid photo ID required. Tickets must be bought in advance\, are nonrefundable\, and there is no late entry after the 8:00 pm start. This is the last session of 2026 before the winter break.\\n\\nCost: $10\\n\\nRegister: https://www.unkindnessart.com/events/nude-figure-drawing-halloween-edition
